                       </p>\n\n                            <p style=\"margin:0 0 45px 0;\">\n                                Please log in to the Provider Portal to view your message.\n                            </p>\n\n                            <p style=\"margin:0 0 5px 0;color:#6B7A90;\">\n                                Thank you,\n                            </p>\n\n                            <p style=\"margin:0;color:#344B70;\">\n                                CMDS Next Gen Provider Portal Support Team\n                            </p>\n\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                    <!-- Footer -->\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"background:#F5F7FA;\n                                   padding:32px 40px;\n                                   text-align:center;\n                                   color:#8A9AB0;\n                                   font-size:14px;\n                                   line-height:1.6;\">\n\n                            <div>\n                                This is an automated message from the CMDS Next Gen Provider Portal.\n                                Please do not reply directly to this email.\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\n                                © @{formatDateTime(utcNow(),'yyyy')} CMDS Next Gen Provider Portal · All rights reserved\n                            </div>\n\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                </table>\n\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n\n    </table>\n\n</div>",
                          "emailMessage/Importance": "Normal"
                        },
